e2e/screenshots/
# Python 工具（scripts/arcCover）喺 repo 根跑 pytest / ruff 會留低 cache；prettier 跟 root .gitignore
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
# 封面 review 頁（scripts/arcCover/review）：生成物預設寫去 repo 外嘅 work 資料夾；
# 萬一 --work / --out 指咗入 repo，候選圖、原圖、rounds.json、files.json 都唔好 commit（大 binary）
/arcCover/
/arcCover-src/
/review/
scripts/arcCover/review/**/site/
scripts/arcCover/review/**/rounds.json
scripts/arcCover/review/**/files.json
scripts/arcCover/review/**/*.png
scripts/arcCover/review/**/*.jpg
scripts/arcCover/review/**/*.webp
